 236:source\asw/wav_parser.c **** /**
 237:source\asw/wav_parser.c ****  * \brief Check the decoded fmt fields against what the player can output (N9).
 238:source\asw/wav_parser.c ****  *
 239:source\asw/wav_parser.c ****  * Writes one UART line for the first violated constraint.
 240:source\asw/wav_parser.c ****  *
 241:source\asw/wav_parser.c ****  * \param[in] hdr  Header with the fmt fields filled in (extensible already resolved)
 242:source\asw/wav_parser.c ****  * \return RC_SUCCESS if the format is supported, otherwise RC_ERROR
